<title>USA: U.S. ammonia, DAP prices steady in quiet markets.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia, DAP prices steady in quiet markets.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate and ammonia were unchanged Monday in quiet activity, dealers said. Midwest farmers have largely completed fertilizer applications and were focused on planting.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton    Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		174-176	     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  188-189	     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170		   unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
